# __GAME_TITLE__

A 2-player game on duel-game-core
(https://github.com/research-ag/duel-core): `src/__RULES_MODULE__.mo`
holds the rules, `src/Host.mo` the host actor, `frontend/` the page.
Read `.claude/skills/duel-game-core/SKILL.md` before changing anything;
for a change to the live game, its `references/changing-a-live-game.md`.

## Live

| Canister | Id                | Runs                               |
| -------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| backend  | `__BACKEND_ID__`  | the game; the module store has it  |
| frontend | `__FRONTEND_ID__` | https://__FRONTEND_ID__.icp0.io/   |
| bot      | `__BOT_ID__`      | `bot/`, registered as "__BOT_NAME__" |

Deployed through __ROUTE__ (`going-live.md`: hosty.live, or icp-cli).
Drop the bot row when there is none.

## What the game runs

- Mode: `#__MODE__`.
- Bot support (the Host's and the page's BOTS lines): __BOTS__.
- Leaderboard (LEADERBOARD lines, rating `__RATING__`): __LEADERBOARD__.
- A bot canister: __BOT_CANISTER__ (complexities: __COMPLEXITIES__).
- duel-game-core: __BACKEND_PACKAGE__ (mops) and
  `@research-ag/duel-game-core` __NPM_VERSION__ (npm).

## Working here

- The default branch is the game: merge finished work there, and
  update this file whenever a canister or a feature changes.
- `mops test`; `cd frontend && npm run build && node play-test.mjs`.
- Before upgrading the backend: `cd frontend && node check-upgrade.mjs
<backend-id>` must exit 0.
- A change to `View`, `Action`, `Options` or the rules updates
  `SEMANTICS` in the same change.
